    content: `<h2>Professional Butler Service in Bali, by the Day</h2><p>Some occasions call for a level of hospitality that elevates everything around it. myCHEF provides trained, English-speaking butlers in Bali on a daily and per-shift basis, giving you polished, anticipatory guest service exactly when you need it, without a long-term commitment. Perfect for villa stays, dinner parties, celebrations, and visiting guests across Seminyak, Canggu, Uluwatu, and Ubud.</p><p>Booking by the day means you bring in professional hospitality for the moments that matter, whether that is a single special evening or a run of busy days with a full house.</p><h3>What Our Butlers Do</h3><p>A myCHEF butler manages the flow of your villa and the comfort of your guests with quiet precision. Typical responsibilities include:</p><ul><li>Welcoming and attending to guests with warm, discreet service</li><li>Serving meals, drinks, and canapes to a refined standard</li><li>Coordinating with your chef and household staff during events</li><li>Managing table settings, beverage service, and guest requests</li><li>Keeping common areas immaculate and the day running smoothly</li></ul><h3>Daily and Shift-Based Flexibility</h3><p>Not every household needs full-time staff. Our daily-rate model lets you scale service up for a party, a holiday week, or a special occasion, then scale back down afterwards. It is the ideal way to enjoy professional butler service for a wedding weekend, a milestone birthday, or simply to make a luxury villa stay feel effortless.</p><p>Learn more about the standard and style of our hosts on our <a href="/in-villa-service/butlers">butler service page</a>. If you decide you would like consistent support throughout a longer stay, we can arrange ongoing or live-in placements through our <a href="/staffing">villa staffing service</a>.</p><h3>Trained, Discreet, and Guest-Ready</h3><p>Our butlers are selected for their poise, professionalism, and ability to read a room. They speak English fluently, present immaculately, and bring genuine warmth to their service, the kind of hospitality that guests remember long after they leave.</p><h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3><p><strong>Can I book a butler for just one evening?</strong> Yes. We offer single-shift and full-day bookings, ideal for dinners and one-off events.</p><p><strong>Can a butler work alongside our chef?</strong> Absolutely. Our butlers regularly coordinate with private chefs to deliver seamless in-villa dining.</p><p><strong>What is the daily rate?</strong> Rates depend on the length of service and the size of your event. See our <a href="/pricing">pricing page</a>, or request a <a href="/quote">quote</a> for your dates.</p>`,
