    content: `<h2>Gourmet Healthy Meal Delivery and Prep in Indonesia</h2><p>Eating well should never mean eating dull. myCHEF brings chef-prepared healthy meal delivery and in-villa meal prep to Bali and Jakarta, pairing organic ingredients and nutrient-dense menus with the flavour and finish you would expect from our private dining work. Whether you are on a wellness retreat, a long villa stay, or simply want to eat better without thinking about it, we make nourishing food effortless.</p><h3>Wellness Without Compromise</h3><p>Our menus are designed by Michelin-trained chefs who treat healthy cooking as a discipline, not a sacrifice. We build balanced plates around fresh local produce, quality proteins, and vibrant Indonesian and international flavours, so every meal supports your goals while still being something you genuinely look forward to.</p><h3>Ways We Keep You Fed</h3><ul><li>Chef-prepared meals delivered ready to enjoy</li><li>In-villa meal prep stocked for the days ahead</li><li>Menus tailored to your nutrition goals and preferences</li><li>Support for vegan, gluten-free, low-carb, and other dietary needs</li><li>Organic and locally sourced ingredients wherever possible</li></ul><h3>Built Around Your Goals</h3><p>Training for something, recovering, managing a specific diet, or just trying to feel better on holiday? We tailor portions, macros, and ingredients to suit. Tell us how you like to eat and our chefs handle the planning, shopping, cooking, and presentation, leaving you with clean, delicious food and zero admin.</p><h3>Frequently Asked</h3><p><strong>Can you cater to strict dietary plans?</strong> Yes. We regularly prepare meals for specific nutritional targets and allergies, and we are happy to work alongside your own plan.</p><p><strong>Is this delivery or in-villa cooking?</strong> Both. We can deliver ready meals or have a chef prep fresh in your kitchen, depending on your stay and preference.</p><p>For full personal-chef and dining options, explore our <a href="/fine-dining">private chef services</a>, and review how we structure packages on the <a href="/pricing">pricing page</a> before you order.</p>`,
